      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 879850669860624744, guid: 8c674a4c14a69ed4db34a6efff8964aa, type: 3}
      propertyPath: statements.Array.data[0].message
      value: "First, I got a fireplace set up. My measurement-devices measured the
        fire at 180\xB0C"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 879850669860624744, guid: 8c674a4c14a69ed4db34a6efff8964aa, type: 3}
      propertyPath: statements.Array.data[1].message
      value: Afterwards, I mixed together a pound of prey in a bowl, with two to
        four ping pong balls and some greens.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 879850669860624744, guid: 8c674a4c14a69ed4db34a6efff8964aa, type: 3}
      propertyPath: statements.Array.data[2].message
      value: I also added the ingredient of anger, a secure-spicer, a cromch of bread,
        and a hacked sadness-spreader.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 879850669860624744, guid: 8c674a4c14a69ed4db34a6efff8964aa, type: 3}
      propertyPath: statements.Array.data[3].message
      value: The ingredients then were mixed and rolled into small balls and put
        onto a baking plate.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 879850669860624744, guid: 8c674a4c14a69ed4db34a6efff8964aa, type: 3}
      propertyPath: statements.Array.data[4].message
      value: I put the small balls into the fireplace for 20 to 30 minutes, until
        brown.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 879850669860624744, guid: 8c674a4c14a69ed4db34a6efff8964aa, type: 3}
      propertyPath: statements.Array.data[5].message
      value: 'In the meantime, I put a bit of water in a pot, let it cook, and then
        I added longg webby thingies until soft. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 879850669860624744, guid: 8c674a4c14a69ed4db34a6efff8964aa, type: 3}
      propertyPath: statements.Array.data[6].message
      value: After the small balls are done, I prepared yum yum sauce in another
        pot and let it cook for 20 minutes at low heat.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 879850669860624744, guid: 8c674a4c14a69ed4db34a6efff8964aa, type: 3}
      propertyPath: statements.Array.data[7].message
      value: I then discarded the small balls because they aren't really necessary.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
